# The build context is uploaded to the daemon in full on every build. `target/`
# alone is over a gigabyte here, and the rest of this list is things that should
# not travel to a daemon at all: a local recovery file holds the passwords that
# decrypt every backup, and `certs/` is where the README's TLS section puts a
# private key.
target/
.git/
.github/
certs/
*.pem
.env
recovery*.txt
peerbackup-data/
review/
*.md
!README.md
